  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1901.02 Applicability",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1901.02 Applicability. The requirements set forth in Env-Wq 1900 shall apply to:\n\n(a) Designated rivers or river segments and their tributary drainage areas;\n\n(b) Affected water users; and\n\n(c) Affected dam owners and the associated water body impounded by the dam.\n\nSource. #7901, eff 5-29-03 (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1900) (formerly Env-Ws 1901.02) ); ss by #9936, eff 5-28-11; ss by #12695, eff 12-22-18",
